      "field": "content",
      "value": "The module expands and deepens the philological‑linguistic skills acquired in preceding modules. A key step is learning the oldest Egyptian language stage, Old Egyptian. In the tutorial (P 7.2 Intensification) the most important fundamentals of Egyptian writing and language, especially on a theoretical level, are supplemented with advanced literature.",
